an></p><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>U.S NEWS</span></strong><strong><span> 深圳大学人工智能专业</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>国际排名 全球47位</span></strong></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span><span>融合深圳大学两个最热门的强势学科资源</span></span></p><p><span><span>深圳大学计算机学科ESI排名进入全球5‱ </span></span></p><p><span><span>工程学科计入全球千分之一</span></span></p><p><span><span>依托大数据系统计算技术国家工程实验室，</span></span></p><p><span><span>射频异质异异构全国重点实验室</span></span></p><p><span><span>智算中心投入超过1.2个亿</span></span></p><p><span><span>为发展提供广阔前景</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/BmFG1NicHSQjCLibicImGmgvKrX6b2U7Z6IZSvIreEDUKnAaicN3mHgq2n9iaawueXlrAJtw8OwGMmDgN9gUTmpRbow/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>05 </span></strong><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><strong><span>类别</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><b><span>类型</span></b></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><strong><span>专业</span></strong></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>智能科学与技术</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>专业型</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>人工智能</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>博士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>计算机科学与技术</span></p><p><span>（人工智能方向）</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>博士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>专业型</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>人工智能</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/BmFG1NicHSQjCLibicImGmgvKrX6b2U7Z6IZSvIreEDUKnAaicN3mHgq2n9iaawueXlrAJtw8OwGMmDgN9gUTmpRbow/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>06 </span></strong><strong><span>招生咨询</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.咨询电话：</span></strong></p><p><span>0755-26946884 杨老师 </span></p><p><span>0755-86938534 刘老师</span></p><p><strong><span>2.咨询邮箱：</span></strong></p><p><span>mingyinY@szu.edu.cn / bvliu@szu.edu.cn</span></p><p><strong><span>3.官方网站：人工智能学院（大数据系统计算技术国家工程实验室）</span></strong></p><p><span>https://bdsc.szu.edu.cn/</span></p><p><strong><span>4.通讯地址：</span></strong><span>广东省深圳市南山区深圳大学沧海校区致真楼10楼</span></p><p><strong><span>5.2026级微信咨询群（报名后请加群）：</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ip1j9ymPibVDdVwIZicmndTCfjibFOGia1L2ahaXNvib6vsSibPDNquLgWmgDTsuo4bKRNhx3f9zGbDDGqFEaEq9guAw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kiaro93upuMDYc5GhVSFc2zIJ6Keoqt3X24icQnKwOWonlAiczL2EKu3BkzETWZq38G1CsWKPBlokcROichldgN2Pw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/BmFG1NicHSQjCLibicImGmgvKrX6b2U7Z6IZSvIreEDUKnAaicN3mHgq2n9iaawueXlrAJtw8OwGMmDgN9gUTmpRbow/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>07 </span></strong><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>　　深圳大学人工智能学科的发展，始于对时代机遇的精准把握与战略布局。2018年，深圳大学联合腾讯云共建深大腾讯云人工智能学院，开启校企协同育人新篇章；2019年，深大-恩智浦-百度云工业物联网与人工智能联合实验室正式揭牌，同年，人工智能与数字经济广东省实验室（深圳）落户深大。U.S.News专业排行，深圳大学人工智能学科位列全球第47位。在此积淀之上，学院积极响应国家人工智能发展战略，紧密契合大湾区产业蓬勃需求，依托深圳大学整合全校优势资源重点建设，成为战略性前沿学院。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>师资队伍</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>　　学院由多位院士及国家级人才构建起高水平教学及研究团队。现有教职工超80人，其中包含中国科学院院士2人、日本工程院院士1人、国家级人才5人、国家级青年人才2人。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ip1j9ymPibVDdVwIZicmndTCfjibFOGia1L2njt2OlzvVFCDniaxhOUlxHwTUol6yJA8oVoicLoA5y4TCs4gMQo5AXMg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>办学特色</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><span>　　秉持 “厚基础、重交叉、国际化” 的办学理念，学院特色鲜明。由院士专家、企业负责人组成国际化高水平战略咨询委员会，指导学院发展。通过湾区人工智能产业创新联合体和 X+AI 学科交叉创新联合体，打造从政策引领到产业应用的全链条合作模式。</span></span><span>培养方案注重学生 “四维能力” 提升，通过精英培养体系、交叉课程体系和双导师制产教联合培养体系，培育具备全球视野和创新实践能力的 AI 人才。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ip1j9ymPibVDdVwIZicmndTCfjibFOGia1L2KSGS2ax8CCUCUZgMdR5Ivbfib4DWCYibAB1ibEqHUXdVVKXPyuibNnU6Xg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究中心</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span>　　学院下设多个特色研究中心，覆盖基础研究与应用落地的完整科研体系。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ip1j9ymPibVDdVwIZicmndTCfjibFOGia1L2CW1D9XM82SBO1eSpHaRj4IzuDa7C7R3FkHhm0811GoNsZZmibvON6Pw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><strong><span>学科方向</span></strong></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ip1j9ymPibVDdVwIZicmndTCfjibFOGia1L2icozVDjxtg5YkeDECcSr5icByo0cm0PKm6HWoeIlMGtZfwgiaicvg1CHxQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kiaro93upuMDYc5GhVSFc2zIJ6Keoqt3X24icQnKwOWonlAiczL2EKu3BkzETWZq38G1CsWKPBlokcROichldgN2Pw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/BmFG1NicHSQjCLibicImGmgvKrX6b2U7Z6IZSvIreEDUKnAaicN3mHgq2n9iaawueXlrAJtw8OwGMmDgN9gUTmpRbow/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>08 </span></strong><strong><span>结语</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>　　欢迎加入</span><span><strong><span>人</span></strong><strong><span>工智能学院</span></strong></span><span>（大数据系统计算技术国家工程实验室），欢迎成为这个充满活力和创新的学术团队的一员，共同追求科学的真理，为推动大数据技术的发展做出贡献。我们期待着每一位优秀学子的加入，一起开启学术之旅，共同创造更加美好的未来！（文字 | 杨佳林 责编 | 杨佳林 审核 | 罗成文 李坚强）</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ip1j9ymPibVDdVwIZicmndTCfjibFOGia1L2XU5ic6TKMaxx5bJVTaUo9Lb0C8JVMwfEQ4ibIQWAZ5Wxwmia8ceGSBCAw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/xWqjROf9Xk3Fre4r0vkxaQPm0W4ceF1477taCa0AgiaiaicEF6Y7IDDCsICMKYc1gfUa73uF91YCiaHKicpUOSenO1w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kiaro93upuMDYc5GhVSFc2zIJ6Keoqt3X24icQnKwOWonlAiczL2EKu3BkzETWZq38G1CsWKPBlokcROichldgN2Pw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"260325706eabd5b641e28c73b8df6fdffcebb1df70f37c418f9a229dcda8bca9","textLength":1640,"sourceSha256":"56d69a5ec49e0ee0b8a052f18c05b29cde09e2f7e2c94bf648af7a7589d10c28","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ee44c8151bd499280eb6","title":"2025年深圳大学人工智能学院2026级夏令营邀全国优秀学子共启科研之旅","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:06.745830+00:00"}
